{"time": "20261117T173056Z", "think": null, "command": "(new game)", "result": "A new game.\n\nYou are at Velothi-Ruin-23-M73.\nPeople: Hesh-Var (quest marker); Sarpa Raider; Plague-Dead of Vorannuhl\nDoors: Door to Vault of the Household (locked)\n\n*** Quest started: The Deepest Hall ***\nJournal: The Eye of Argonia is the old priest-kings' jewel. It sits at the Root, under the sea below Teku-Sul Spire, where the roots of every Hist meet; used there, it can heal every sick tree. The last king shut it behind the Kings' Gate, which opens only with three seal-stones. The third seal-stone lies in the vault of Vorannuhl's deep halls, behind a door of bronze. Sarpa raiders shelter in the outer yard, and one of them, Hesh-Var, carries the bronze key. I'm to get the key: lift it from him unseen, or kill him and take it.\nObjective: Get the Bronze Key of Vorannuhl from Hesh-Var in the outer yard. (marker: Hesh-Var, Vorannuhl)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "velothi-ruin-23-m73", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know", "topic.mn09-how-know", "topic.mn10-how-know", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-gaoler-closed", "topic.mn13-which-tower", "topic.mn-seal-stones", "topic.mn13-report"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261117T173101Z", "think": "Starting out. I will answer honestly, then sneak and pickpocket the key.", "command": "answer 1. I am hunting the three seal-stones to open the Kings Gate and reach the Eye of Argonia at the Root. I hold Blackrose and Gemin; the third is in the vault of Vorannuhl behind a bronze door. The Eye used in place heals the trees; lifting it harms them, so I must not lift it. Rivals are the Unbound and the collector Ennodius Vanin. 2. Get the Bronze Key from Hesh-Var, a Sarpa raider in the outer yard of Vorannuhl, then open the vault door. 3. Sneak and pickpocket the key from Hesh-Var, or kill him and take it. I favour sneaking. I could also try the locked vault door by lockpicking (2 lockpicks), though it is bronze and probably needs the key. Paralysis poison is available too. 4. I do not know why the Unbound drain trees, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, or how Nesh-Deeka knows of the Unbound. Plague-Dead of Vorannuhl are here and I am unsure how dangerous they are; I can find out by looking and talking.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "velothi-ruin-23-m73", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": [