{"time": "20261117T173120Z", "think": "Quest done; giving my notes and stopping.", "command": "answer 1. Notes for a friend picking up the save: I lifted the Bronze Key from Hesh-Var unseen (pickpocket), opened the Vault of the Household in Vorannuhl, and took the Seal-Stone of the Kings from the Household Hoard (use the hoard, then take the stone). The Lord of Vorannuhl was in the vault and I did not fight. I now carry all three seal-stones: Blackrose, Gemin and Kings. Never-Writes-Twice ordered all three brought to her before anyone goes near the gate. 2. Next: bring the stones to her in Nesh-Deeka House in Helstrom. After that, the Kings Gate under Teku-Sul Spire (dive from Bell Station). 3. I could go straight to Helstrom as ordered, or head to the gate myself; I think delivering them first is wiser. Do not lift the Eye: used in place it heals the trees, lifted it cuts them off and the weak die alone. Rivals: the Unbound and Collector Ennodius Vanin. I have about 350 gold, Reel-Ka armour, rapier, 2 lockpicks, 3 paralysis poisons, sap jar, keystone, eye-setting. 4. Still unknown: why the Unbound drain trees, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, how Nesh-Deeka knows about the Unbound.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 93, "at": "Vault of the Household", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.not